69">ments</span> <span begin="50.269" end="50.415">in</span> <span begin="50.415" end="50.595">the</span> <span begin="50.595" end="50.874">Bowe</span><span begin="50.874" end="51.127">ry</span> <span begin="51.127" end="51.754">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在鲍厄里的街灯下虚掷了年华</span></p><p begin="54.697" end="56.783" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.697" end="54.989">And</span> <span begin="54.989" end="55.282">lost</span> <span begin="55.282" end="55.813">it</span> <span begin="55.813" end="56.783">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">失去所有</span></p><p begin="59.739" end="1:01.391" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.739" end="1:00.022">So,</span> <span begin="1:00.022" end="1:00.319">are</span> <span begin="1:00.319" end="1:00.645">you</span> <span begin="1:00.645" end="1:00.919">smo</span><span begin="1:00.919" end="1:01.391">king?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以，你在抽烟吗？</span></p><p begin="1:03.552" end="1:06.769" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.552" end="1:03.811">Don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:03.811" end="1:04.098">tell</span> <span begin="1:04.098" end="1:04.422">me,</span> <span begin="1:04.422" end="1:04.742">ba</span><span begin="1:04.742" end="1:05.065">by,</span> <span begin="1:05.065" end="1:05.370">you</span> <span begin="1:05.370" end="1:05.676">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:05.676" end="1:05.963">work</span> <span begin="1:05.963" end="1:06.303">this</span> <span begin="1:06.303" end="1:06.769">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">别跟我说，宝贝，你搞不定这事</span></p><p begin="1:09.267" end="1:12.011" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.267" end="1:09.545">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:09.545" end="1:09.817">was</span><span begin="1:09.817" end="1:10.020">ted</span> <span begin="1:10.020" end="1:10.351">mo</span><span begin="1:10.351" end="1:10.523">ments</span> <span begin="1:10.523" end="1:10.679">in</span> <span begin="1:10.679" end="1:10.863">the</span> <span begin="1:10.863" end="1:11.107">So</span><span begin="1:11.107" end="1:11.370">ho</span> <span begin="1:11.370" end="1:12.011">nights</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在苏荷的夜色里耗尽了时刻</span></p><p begin="1:14.885" end="1:17.102" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.885" end="1:15.161">And</span> <span begin="1:15.161" end="1:15.530">lost</span> <span begin="1:15.530" end="1:16.077">it</span> <span begin="1:16.077" end="1:17.102">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">失去所有</span></p><p begin="1:21.485" end="1:25.800" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:21.485" end="1:21.789">Time</span> <span begin="1:21.789" end="1:22.105">will</span> <span begin="1:22.105" end="1:22.439">tell</span> <span begin="1:22.439" end="1:22.783">if</span> <span begin="1:22.783" end="1:23.071">you</span> <span begin="1:23.071" end="1:23.379">can</span> <span begin="1:23.379" end="1:23.684">fi</span><span begin="1:23.684" end="1:23.982">gure</span> <span begin="1:23.982" end="1:24.263">this</span> <span begin="1:24.263" end="1:24.552">and</span> <span begin="1:24.552" end="1:24.896">work</span> <span begin="1:24.896" end="1:25.251">it</span> <span begin="1:25.251" end="1:25.800">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">时间会告诉你，能不能想明白、搞定这事</span></p><p begin="1:26.512" end="1:30.989" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:26.512" end="1:26.810">No</span> <span begin="1:26.810" end="1:27.170">one&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:27.170" end="1:27.477">wai</span><span begin="1:27.477" end="1:27.786">ting</span> <span begin="1:27.786" end="1:28.074">for</span> <span begin="1:28.074" end="1:28.428">you</span> <span begin="1:28.428" end="1:28.706">a</span><span begin="1:28.706" end="1:29.003">ny</span><span begin="1:29.003" end="1:29.328">way</span> <span begin="1:29.328" end="1:29.631">so</span> <span begin="1:29.631" end="1:30.003">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:30.003" end="1:30.315">be</span> <span begin="1:30.315" end="1:30.621">stressed</span> <span begin="1:30.621" end="1:30.989">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">反正没人等你，别给自己加压</span></p><p begin="1:31.607" end="1:36.094" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:31.607" end="1:31.867">E</span><span begin="1:31.867" end="1:32.240">ven</span> <span begin="1:32.240" end="1:32.534">if</span> <span begin="1:32.534" end="1:32.864">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:32.864" end="1:33.188">some</span><span begin="1:33.188" end="1:33.491">thing</span> <span begin="1:33.491" end="1:33.783">that</span> <span begin="1:33.783" end="1:34.107">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:34.107" end="1:34.399">had</span> <span begin="1:34.399" end="1:34.735">your</span> <span begin="1:34.735" end="1:35.415">eye</span> <span begin="1:35.415" end="1:36.094">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算那是你眼馋已久的</span></p><p begin="1:36.959" end="1:39.581" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:36.959" end="1:37.243">It</span> <span begin="1:37.243" end="1:37.583">is</span> <span begin="1:37.583" end="1:37.913">what</span> <span begin="1:37.913" end="1:38.217">it</span> <span begin="1:38.217" end="1:39.581">is</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">事已至此</span></p><p begin="1:40.153" end="1:41.865" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.153" end="1:40.412">On</span> <span begin="1:40.412" end="1:40.738">your</span> <span begin="1:40.738" end="1:41.051">own</span> <span begin="1:41.051" end="1:41.379">wor</span><span begin="1:41.379" end="1:41.865">ries</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">陷在各自的烦忧里</span></p><p begin="1:44.587" end="1:47.345" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.587" end="1:44.870">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:44.870" end="1:45.152">no</span><span begin="1:45.152" end="1:45.363">thing</span> <span begin="1:45.363" end="1:45.660">e</span><span begin="1:45.660" end="1:45.832">ven</s