</span> <span begin="3:23.056" end="3:23.392">the</span> <span begin="3:23.392" end="3:23.699">sta</span><span begin="3:23.699" end="3:23.981">ges</span> <span begin="3:23.981" end="3:24.312">be</span><span begin="3:24.312" end="3:24.655">fore</span> <span begin="3:24.655" end="3:24.985">I</span> <span begin="3:24.985" end="3:25.287">go</span> <span begin="3:25.287" end="3:25.801">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在我回家前，陪我理清这些情绪好不好</span></p><p begin="3:28.221" end="3:30.718" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.221" end="3:28.515">Why</span> <span begin="3:28.515" end="3:28.812">was</span><span begin="3:28.812" end="3:29.094">n&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:29.094" end="3:29.381">it</span> <span begin="3:29.381" end="3:30.718">real?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为什么不是真的？</span></p><p begin="3:32.285" end="3:36.084" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.285" end="3:32.560">Ro</span><span begin="3:32.560" end="3:32.857">xy</span> <span begin="3:32.857" end="3:33.189">got</span> <span begin="3:33.189" end="3:33.518">me</span> <span begin="3:33.518" end="3:33.826">twitc</span><span begin="3:33.826" end="3:34.107">hing</span> <span begin="3:34.107" end="3:34.410">and</span> <span begin="3:34.410" end="3:34.772">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="3:34.772" end="3:35.085">home</span> <span begin="3:35.085" end="3:35.386">a</span><span begin="3:35.386" end="3:36.084">lone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Roxy的喧闹让我心神不宁，我独自待在家里</span></p><p begin="3:42.303" end="3:45.906" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:42.303" end="3:42.622">Ta</span><span begin="3:42.622" end="3:42.970">king</span> <span begin="3:42.970" end="3:43.257">it</span> <span begin="3:43.257" end="3:43.592">for</span> <span begin="3:43.592" end="3:43.879">gran</span><span begin="3:43.879" end="3:44.173">ted</span> <span begin="3:44.173" end="3:44.474">that</span> <span begin="3:44.474" end="3:44.803">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="3:44.803" end="3:45.181">here</span> <span begin="3:45.181" end="3:45.483">with</span> <span begin="3:45.483" end="3:45.906">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我理所当然以为你会陪在我身边</span></p><p begin="3:48.343" end="3:51.009" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:48.343" end="3:48.683">Just</span> <span begin="3:48.683" end="3:48.981">tell</span> <span begin="3:48.981" end="3:49.292">me</span> <span begin="3:49.292" end="3:49.599">the</span> <span begin="3:49.599" end="3:51.009">truth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就告诉我实话吧</span></p><p begin="3:52.466" end="3:56.009" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:52.466" end="3:52.769">Am</span> <span begin="3:52.769" end="3:53.108">I</span> <span begin="3:53.108" end="3:53.410">just</span> <span begin="3:53.410" end="3:53.734">a</span> <span begin="3:53.734" end="3:54.017">lone</span><span begin="3:54.017" end="3:54.330">ly</span> <span begin="3:54.330" end="3:54.650">fa</span><span begin="3:54.650" end="3:54.979">bled</span> <span begin="3:54.979" end="3:55.283">o</span><span begin="3:55.283" end="3:55.597">bses</span><span begin="3:55.597" end="3:56.009">sive?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">难道我只是个孤独的、传说里的痴迷者？</span></p><p begin="3:58.428" end="4:00.777" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:58.428" end="3:58.790">That</span> <span begin="3:58.790" end="3:59.103">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:59.103" end="3:59.399">got</span> <span begin="3:59.399" end="3:59.716">no</span> <span begin="3:59.716" end="4:00.777">clue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">什么头绪都没有的那种</span></p></div></body></tt>